Why Binary Search Is Fast

Linear Search checks one by one:

1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6 → ...

Binary Search removes half of the elements every step:

100 elements
↓
50
↓
25
↓
12
↓
6
↓
3
↓
1

This makes Binary Search very efficient.

Time Complexity
Case	Time Complexity
Best Case	O(1)
Average Case	O(log n)
Worst Case	O(log n)
